go online and buy one yourself--

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:02.780
Wait!

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:04.680
You can’t promise them stuff you don’t
have!

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.500
This is how the hate comments appear!

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:07.500
What?

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.900
It was funny though--
Funny for you!

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:14.540
I thought you had a pass sitting in the drawer,
but nooo when I checked, there wasn’t one!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:18.460
Well, whatever, the YouTube comments are usually
pretty good at taking a joke right?

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:20.460
*dead silence*

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:24.400
AHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAH--

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:29.860
I know this was something new for us, so if
you are interested in content like this let

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.730
